{"id":"vod_sn_36117","vodId":"36117","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"信蜂 REVERSE","name_cn":"信蜂 REVERSE","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a47028e0effc219f0aa2ea8b4b9fc2e9.jpg"},"summary":"于一个从未迎接过光明的地方AG(阿帕葛兰多，即琥珀之地)，无论是首都还是人工太阳无法照射到的危险土地，都有着冒险替人们递送信件的邮差。人们称这些时刻赌上自己的性命，排除万难，把寄托着人的“心”的信安全运送的邮差为“信蜂”。　　四面环海的GA国是由三个区域组成了严谨的阶级系统，拥有人工太阳是首都“晓”，是上层阶级特定人群的高级都会。然后是中产阶级们的都市“尤萨利”，还有聚集了下等阶级贫苦居民的第三区域“悠达卡”。　　在这三个区域间，有着只放行持有政府发放的通行证的人的“桥梁”。而那颗小小的人工太阳只为照耀首都而存在着，世界深不见底的黑暗所包围。　　在这样一个世界里，有着充当连接人心的桥梁的邮差——信蜂。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:40:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/URWKGSJPpP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pqqk2QgevA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6e9NiJjAxd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yEGXqXCUHL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3tkP78jzCY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ijc0K2QWy31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6ij7EVJEPK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v1cs4kQwWR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZvwEg3XQRx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2sCpBfb8n21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CMSw7wG9a11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iA6v0C1ptJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YC8FKid1Sn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/310akfUskX1/video